# A flat stand under the cube. It's a model, so the build cooks it with Assimp, the cook tool's native
# library, and a package that packs Assimp where the tool can't find it fails here.
o stand
v -1 -0.1 -1
v 1 -0.1 -1
v 1 -0.1 1
v -1 -0.1 1
v -1 0.1 -1
v 1 0.1 -1
v 1 0.1 1
v -1 0.1 1
f 1 2 3 4
f 8 7 6 5
f 1 5 6 2
f 2 6 7 3
f 3 7 8 4
f 4 8 5 1
